1
00:00:00,918 --> 00:00:03,838
(Leonard:)I'm sorry,
we cannot do this without Wolowitz.

2
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:06,924
(Leonard:)We can't order Chinese food
without Wolowitz?

3
00:00:07,091 --> 00:00:08,381
(Sheldon:)Let me walk you through it.

4
00:00:08,551 --> 00:00:11,261
Our standard order is,
the steamed dumpling appetizer...

5
00:00:11,428 --> 00:00:13,558
...General Tso's chicken,
beef with broccoli...

6
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:16,102
(Sheldon:)...shrimp with lobster sauce,
and vegetable lo mein.

7
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:18,187
(Sheldon:)Do you see the problem?

8
00:00:19,645 --> 00:00:21,605
(Leonard:)I see a problem.

9
00:00:21,772 --> 00:00:25,402
(Sheldon:)Our entire order is predicated
on four dumplings and four entrées...

10
00:00:25,568 --> 00:00:28,068
...divided amongst four people.

11
00:00:29,905 --> 00:00:32,075
So we'll just order three entrées.

12
00:00:32,241 --> 00:00:33,821
Fine. What do you wanna eliminate?

13
00:00:33,993 --> 00:00:36,913
- And who gets the extra dumpling?
- We could cut it into thirds.

14
00:00:37,079 --> 00:00:38,539
Then it's no longer a dumpling.

15
00:00:38,706 --> 00:00:42,496
(Sheldon:)Once you cut it open, it is, at best,
a very small open-faced sandwich.

16
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:44,250
(Waiter:)Hi, fellas.

17
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:49,050
(Waiter:)Oh. Where's your annoying little friend
who thinks he speaks Mandarin?

18
00:00:49,216 --> 00:00:51,636
(Sheldon:)He's putting his needs
ahead of the collective good.

19
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:54,182
(Sheldon:)Where he comes from,
that's punishable by death.

20
00:00:54,805 --> 00:01:00,025
(Waiter:)I come from Sacramento.

